<title>UK: Council of Europe sets 1.0 bln CZK one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets 1.0 bln CZK one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    28.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 25-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  85 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
